{"id":"nueve","lemma":"nueve","pos":"noun","rank":846,"glosses":["the digit or figure 9"],"ipa":"/ˈnwebe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nueves"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-nueve.wav","examples":[{"text":"Abre tu libro por la página nueve.","en":"Open your book to page nine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330679","words":[{"g":"to open, open up","l":"abrir"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"page"},null]},{"text":"¿Nos vemos mañana por la mañana a las nueve?","en":"Shall we meet tomorrow morning at nine?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730908","words":[null,null,{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"cheers, goodbye"]]},{"text":"Necesito nueve horas de sueño.","en":"I need nine hours of sleep.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594237","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sleep, slumber"}]},{"text":"Tom trabaja desde las nueve hasta las cinco.","en":"Tom works from nine to five.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333191","words":[null,{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"until"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"a five"}]},{"text":"Él dijo: \"son las nueve.\"","en":"He said, \"It's nine o'clock.\"","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333006","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}